add('SP-H-LATCH','Hold-branch finite latch bound','EXACT_CONDITIONAL','D_H≤(B−k)+2+delta','H can latch with unused active and queued stock. The C exhaustion theorem cannot be reused for H.','§7','H never closes',[choice('SP-HOLD','Makes prior open responses persistent.'),proof('SP-DRIVE','An open response inhibits later stock pulses.'),choice('SP-BANK','Only quiescent states can load further packets.'),choice('SP-STOP','A full fixed point is a model halt, not physical no-event.')])
